OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder inquiry as man
OL,4,Afound with burns
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn attempted murder investigation has
OL,7,Fbeen launched in Doncaster after a man
OL,8,Fwas found with life-threatening
OL,9,Finjuries described by police as burns.
OL,11,FSouth Yorkshire Police were called to
OL,12,Freports of an injured man on Warmsworth
OL,13,FRoad at 23:35 BST on Tuesday.
OL,15,FHe was taken to hospital by the
OL,16,Fambulance service where he remains in a
OL,17,Fserious condition.
OL,19,FPolice said inquiries were moving "at
OL,20,Fpace" and appealed for anyone with
OL,21,Finformation to get in touch.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
